1
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,509
♪The world keeps changing♪

2
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,979
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

3
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,159
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

4
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,399
♪We stand above the world♪

5
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,590
♪Our identities switch♪

6
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:29,320
♪The world turns upside down♪

7
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,729
♪Watch me♪

8
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:35,319
♪Stir up a storm♪

9
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,609
♪Let's time-travel, bro♪

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:40,059
♪Our blood is boiling♪

11
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:45,289
♪The genius emperor plots
with brilliant strategy♪

12
00:00:45,290 --> 00:00:49,709
♪The slacker general
is unmatched in battle♪

13
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,199
♪The business world is in turmoil♪

14
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,749
♪The court is rife with intrigue♪

15
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:59,169
♪We will conquer the world♪

16
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:03,510
♪There's no escape for the traitors♪

17
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:08,076
=No Way! My Bro Is the Emperor=

18
00:01:08,077 --> 00:01:11,237
=Episode 24=

19
00:01:11,330 --> 00:01:13,739
Just three thousand Imperial Guards?

20
00:01:13,740 --> 00:01:14,899
How can they stand against

21
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:16,519
my fifty thousand Western Yi cavalry?

22
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,280
(Taiji Hall)

23
00:01:19,850 --> 00:01:21,650
You're a citizen of Jing too.

24
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:23,370
Don't you know

25
00:01:23,460 --> 00:01:27,220
that inviting wolves into your home
will only get you devoured in the end?

26
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:28,700
Devoured?

27
00:01:29,490 --> 00:01:31,869
Do you think
I actually trusted those barbarians?

28
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:34,700
They're nothing more
than pawns in my game.

29
00:01:35,050 --> 00:01:36,459
Your relief army

30
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:37,899
will be here soon, won't it?

31
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,530
Once you're dead,

32
00:01:40,380 --> 00:01:42,659
I'll assume command

33
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:44,299
as head of the imperial family

34
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,860
and order them
to wipe out the Western Yi.

35
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:47,170
By then,

36
00:01:47,580 --> 00:01:49,650
I'll be hailed as the hero

37
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:51,899
who quelled the rebellion

38
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:53,450
and repelled the invaders.

39
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:55,489
Then I'll rightfully

40
00:01:55,490 --> 00:01:56,530
ascend the throne

41
00:01:56,900 --> 00:01:57,980
and become Emperor.

42
00:02:00,250 --> 00:02:02,530
So you're planning to double-cross them.

43
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:04,980
Clever scheme.

44
00:02:06,050 --> 00:02:07,370
You vicious woman!

45
00:02:07,610 --> 00:02:08,329
So

46
00:02:08,330 --> 00:02:10,340
you've been using us all along.

47
00:02:10,420 --> 00:02:11,609
And now you want

48
00:02:11,610 --> 00:02:12,930
to wipe us out too.

49
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:13,580
You...

50
00:02:13,770 --> 00:02:15,020
How are you here?

51
00:02:17,650 --> 00:02:18,699
But us?

52
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,790
The two of us

53
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:22,060
can't even outsmart these ancient people.

54
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,630
The two of us...

55
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:29,360
The Princess Royal
has allied with the Western Yi.

56
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:31,250
Their alliance is already falling apart.

57
00:02:31,860 --> 00:02:33,300
Let's divide and conquer.

58
00:02:34,650 --> 00:02:37,349
I'll deal with the Western Yi.
You handle the Princess Royal.

59
00:02:37,350 --> 00:02:38,699
This is a dangerous mission.

60
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:39,899
We need a fallback plan.

61
00:02:39,900 --> 00:02:40,900
We need to

62
00:02:40,930 --> 00:02:42,510
keep Xiao Ling and Gu Nan safe.

63
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,929
(Changle Gate)

64
00:02:44,930 --> 00:02:45,740
Commander,

65
00:02:46,610 --> 00:02:47,369
these two

66
00:02:47,370 --> 00:02:49,019
snuck in wearing our armor.

67
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,900
They're clearly Jing spies.

68
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:53,850
I'm not from Jing.

69
00:02:54,090 --> 00:02:55,130
I'm from the Western Yi.

70
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:01,780
So you really are.

71
00:03:02,210 --> 00:03:03,369
Then why

72
00:03:03,370 --> 00:03:04,970
are you helping the people of Jing?

73
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:05,929
Then why are you

74
00:03:05,930 --> 00:03:07,900
taking orders
from the Princess Royal of Jing?

75
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:09,649
She promised me cities.

76
00:03:09,650 --> 00:03:10,900
You can't trust her.

77
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:13,239
She threatened my brother's life

78
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,580
to make me work for her.

79
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:16,259
But in the end, she betrayed me

80
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:17,370
and tried to silence me.

81
00:03:17,610 --> 00:03:18,460
Now

82
00:03:18,650 --> 00:03:20,180
she's using you too.

83
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,179
I've already made a pact

84
00:03:22,180 --> 00:03:23,089
with the Princess Royal.

85
00:03:23,090 --> 00:03:24,900
She never intended
to give you those cities.

86
00:03:25,050 --> 00:03:27,250
She doesn't even intend
to let you leave alive.

87
00:03:27,330 --> 00:03:29,500
If you don't believe me,
come with me to the main hall.

88
00:03:29,810 --> 00:03:31,460
Whether you choose war or peace,

89
00:03:31,930 --> 00:03:33,180
you can decide for yourself.

90
00:03:35,300 --> 00:03:36,179
We Western Yi

91
00:03:36,180 --> 00:03:37,019
don't follow

92
00:03:37,020 --> 00:03:38,900
treacherous backstabbers like you.

93
00:03:38,930 --> 00:03:40,209
What we want

94
00:03:40,210 --> 00:03:41,930
isn't bloodshed.

95
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:43,909
Your Western Yi army

96
00:03:43,910 --> 00:03:45,900
(Taiji Hall)
no longer answers to you.

97
00:03:46,090 --> 00:03:46,780
You

98
00:03:48,210 --> 00:03:49,460
have nowhere left to run.

99
00:03:50,430 --> 00:03:51,549
Xiao Ce,

100
00:03:51,550 --> 00:03:53,130
you'll never defeat me.

101
00:03:53,420 --> 00:03:54,370
Guards!

102
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:55,780
Kill them!

103
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:57,000
Protect His Majesty!

104
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,040
(Taiji Hall)

105
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:21,629
♪The world keeps changing♪

106
00:04:21,630 --> 00:04:24,099
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

107
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:26,279
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

108
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,599
♪We stand above the world♪

109
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:31,579
♪I open the pages of history♪

110
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:34,189
♪The ink is still fresh♪

111
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:35,789
♪I close my eyes, the screen flashes♪

112
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:38,269
♪And I'm in another dynasty♪

113
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:40,999
♪From library to the imperial court♪

114
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,379
♪This top student has gone a little mad♪

115
00:04:43,380 --> 00:04:45,899
♪From the arcade to the mustering ground♪

116
00:04:45,900 --> 00:04:46,700
Your Majesty,

117
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:47,619
we won't let you

118
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:48,529
fight alone.

119
00:04:48,530 --> 00:04:49,169
You all...

120
00:04:49,170 --> 00:04:50,899
♪One with brains and brawn♪

121
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:52,900
I was going to teach them
some self-defense,

122
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:54,140
but Gu Nan insisted

123
00:04:54,170 --> 00:04:56,139
on learning how to use
the Pocket Blaster.

124
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:56,819
So

125
00:04:56,820 --> 00:04:58,260
I gathered the ladies of the harem

126
00:04:58,330 --> 00:04:59,529
and formed

127
00:04:59,530 --> 00:05:00,700
the Imperial Harem Guard.

128
00:05:01,330 --> 00:05:02,089
Your Majesty,

129
00:05:02,090 --> 00:05:03,610
you protect Jing,

130
00:05:03,770 --> 00:05:05,260
and we'll protect you.

131
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:09,800
♪Stir up a storm♪

132
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,659
You pride yourself on your schemes,

133
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:13,529
♪Our blood is boiling♪

134
00:05:13,530 --> 00:05:15,600
yet you've forgotten the simplest truth.

135
00:05:15,850 --> 00:05:17,140
Win the people's hearts,

136
00:05:17,230 --> 00:05:18,780
and you'll win the realm.

137
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:20,070
Otherwise,

138
00:05:20,530 --> 00:05:22,090
no matter how clever your schemes,

139
00:05:22,770 --> 00:05:23,499
they're nothing

140
00:05:23,500 --> 00:05:24,820
but a fleeting illusion.

141
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:26,490
In the end,

142
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,220
you'll lose it all.

143
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:32,089
♪We will conquer the world♪

144
00:05:32,090 --> 00:05:34,169
Princess Royal Xiao,

145
00:05:34,170 --> 00:05:35,729
arrogant in her rank,

146
00:05:35,730 --> 00:05:37,170
colluded with foreign forces,

147
00:05:37,210 --> 00:05:38,699
and conspired against the state,

148
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,089
guilty of treason.

149
00:05:40,090 --> 00:05:40,719
Hence,

150
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,199
she is stripped of her title

151
00:05:42,200 --> 00:05:43,619
and ordered to take her own life.

152
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:46,059
Gu Bei, for saving the nation,

153
00:05:46,060 --> 00:05:48,139
is appointed General of the First Rank

154
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:52,210
and granted marriage
to Xiao Ling, Hulv, and Yanqiu.

155
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:54,260
That's all.

156
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,240
(Work Hard, Chill)

157
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:11,120
(Chill)

158
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,089
I just had a fun idea.

159
00:06:17,090 --> 00:06:18,140
What is it?

160
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,320
(Chill, Work Hard)

161
00:06:21,410 --> 00:06:22,290
Let's switch.

162
00:06:22,460 --> 00:06:23,169
I'll run

163
00:06:23,170 --> 00:06:25,409
Xiaoyao Pavilion,
and you'll be Emperor for a few days.

164
00:06:25,410 --> 00:06:26,640
It's settled.

165
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:28,900
I never agreed.

166
00:06:31,130 --> 00:06:33,380
This is ridiculous.

167
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,360
(Work Hard)

168
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,169
Such a tiny matter,

169
00:06:41,170 --> 00:06:42,460
yet it takes 3,000 words?

170
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:47,020
Draft an imperial decree.

171
00:06:47,210 --> 00:06:48,059
From now on,

172
00:06:48,060 --> 00:06:49,090
no memorial

173
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:51,380
may exceed 200 words.

174
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,729
One word over,

175
00:06:52,730 --> 00:06:53,970
and it'll be returned.

176
00:06:54,820 --> 00:06:55,940
Anyone who disobeys...

177
00:06:57,940 --> 00:06:58,780
No one is to disobey.

178
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,050
Yes, Your Majesty.

179
00:07:04,410 --> 00:07:05,260
These are

180
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:06,819
the assets confiscated

181
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,140
from corrupt officials.

182
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:10,940
Should we

183
00:07:10,970 --> 00:07:12,259
turn them over to the Treasury?

184
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:13,170
Treasury?

185
00:07:13,460 --> 00:07:14,259
Deposit every coin

186
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:15,519
into Xiaoyao Pavilion.

187
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,640
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

188
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:25,579
A little harder.

189
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:26,490
Yes.

190
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:28,730
(Chill)
How's the pressure?

191
00:07:29,210 --> 00:07:30,290
Not bad.

192
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:32,290
Harder.

193
00:07:33,530 --> 00:07:35,440
Easy. Easy.

194
00:07:36,090 --> 00:07:36,649
Boss,

195
00:07:36,650 --> 00:07:37,849
please review today's accounts.

196
00:07:37,850 --> 00:07:38,900
No rush.

197
00:07:38,970 --> 00:07:40,089
It's almost quitting time.

198
00:07:40,090 --> 00:07:41,900
Whatever it is,
it can wait until tomorrow.

199
00:07:42,530 --> 00:07:43,499
There's nothing so urgent

200
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,170
it must be done today.

201
00:07:46,260 --> 00:07:47,730
That's a first.

202
00:07:48,060 --> 00:07:50,140
Your Majesty used to be
swamped with work every day.

203
00:07:50,410 --> 00:07:52,460
You're enjoying an easy life now.

204
00:07:52,900 --> 00:07:55,169
Gu Bei was right.

205
00:07:55,170 --> 00:07:56,059
Life isn't only

206
00:07:56,060 --> 00:07:57,259
about responsibilities.

207
00:07:57,260 --> 00:07:59,340
You should enjoy it too.

208
00:08:01,210 --> 00:08:02,459
I love

209
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:04,240
myself.

210
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:08,010
Your Majesty,

211
00:08:08,090 --> 00:08:09,059
are you truly at ease

212
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:10,059
leaving the realm

213
00:08:10,060 --> 00:08:11,020
to Nan?

214
00:08:16,210 --> 00:08:18,019
The realm is at peace now.

215
00:08:18,020 --> 00:08:19,340
The people prosper,

216
00:08:19,530 --> 00:08:20,700
and the court is upright.

217
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:22,490
Anyone can be Emperor.

218
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:25,410
Besides,

219
00:08:25,580 --> 00:08:26,939
Gu Bei may seem carefree,

220
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:28,530
but he's sensible.

221
00:08:28,580 --> 00:08:29,610
He won't mess it up.

222
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:31,499
Absolutely not!

223
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:33,730
This goes against
our ancestral laws and the rites.

224
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:36,449
Nowhere do the laws and rites say

225
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:37,339
ill-gotten gains

226
00:08:37,340 --> 00:08:39,099
can't benefit the people.

227
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:40,130
Just get it done.

228
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:42,890
What was Xiao's word again?

229
00:08:44,410 --> 00:08:45,090
Efficiency.

230
00:08:45,170 --> 00:08:46,490
Efficiency.

231
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:51,610
The realm is important,

232
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:53,010
but to me,

233
00:08:53,450 --> 00:08:54,970
what matters most now

234
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,180
is spending more time
with the woman I love

235
00:08:58,340 --> 00:09:00,180
and making up for the time we lost.

236
00:09:01,070 --> 00:09:02,490
Hearing what Your Majesty says

237
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:04,049
puts my mind at ease.

238
00:09:04,050 --> 00:09:05,250
Why are you still calling me
"Your Majesty"?

239
00:09:10,450 --> 00:09:11,710
Now,

240
00:09:12,170 --> 00:09:14,610
I'm just the owner of Xiaoyao Pavilion

241
00:09:15,570 --> 00:09:17,060
and your husband.

242
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:26,689
Today,

243
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:28,730
I've finished all the memorials.

244
00:09:29,220 --> 00:09:31,970
So next, shouldn't I...

245
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:34,880
I understand.

246
00:09:35,980 --> 00:09:37,220
Guards!

247
00:09:40,650 --> 00:09:42,529
I'll help her choose.

248
00:09:42,530 --> 00:09:43,600
(Yan Qiu)

249
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,300
(Xiao Ling)

250
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:51,820
(Hulv)

251
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,859
(Yan Qiu, Xiao Ling, Hulv)

252
00:10:02,860 --> 00:10:04,539
Why are these all my own wives?

253
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:05,109
Uh...

254
00:10:05,110 --> 00:10:06,409
Gu Bei!

255
00:10:06,410 --> 00:10:07,899
Whose wife were you planning to meet?

256
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:09,259
You think you're really the Emperor?

257
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:11,010
The three of us aren't enough?

258
00:10:11,290 --> 00:10:13,049
You're still eyeing other women?

259
00:10:13,050 --> 00:10:14,460
Now that's bold.

260
00:10:14,670 --> 00:10:15,859
You can't put it that way.

261
00:10:15,860 --> 00:10:16,540
I...

262
00:10:19,610 --> 00:10:21,220
I have a friend,

263
00:10:21,340 --> 00:10:22,820
Xiaobao.

264
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:24,540
He has seven wives.

265
00:10:24,650 --> 00:10:26,060
The more, the merrier.

266
00:10:26,290 --> 00:10:27,069
The merrier?

267
00:10:27,070 --> 00:10:28,019
Then let's give you

268
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,560
a real party today.

269
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,499
Girls,

270
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:33,899
let's get him!

271
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:35,700
Show him what we're made of.

272
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:48,010
Watch out!

273
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:50,090
Gu Bei!

274
00:10:50,570 --> 00:10:51,259
Gu Bei!

275
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,019
Get back here!

276
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:52,730
Stop!

277
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:53,809
Stop!

278
00:10:53,810 --> 00:10:54,379
- Just you wait!
- Guards!

279
00:10:54,380 --> 00:10:55,339
- You'll regret this!
- Stop!

280
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:56,169
Guards! Guards!

281
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:58,250
They're trying to kill their husband!

282
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:01,240
(The Best Pavilion in the World)

283
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:08,969
♪The world keeps changing♪

284
00:11:08,970 --> 00:11:11,439
♪A thousand years pass
in the blink of an eye♪

285
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,619
♪Shoulder to shoulder♪

286
00:11:13,620 --> 00:11:15,949
♪We stand above the world♪

287
00:11:15,950 --> 00:11:19,019
♪I open the pages of history♪

288
00:11:19,020 --> 00:11:21,639
♪The ink is still fresh♪

289
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:23,169
